Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.27,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(715.999,39.251)}Terrifying Gorgon's Head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.27,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\pos(509.333,1003)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.61,0:00:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,As your punishment, stand outside the classroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.77,0:00:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My feet hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sprained my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a gadget that will protect my feet from getting sprained?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You do nothing and yet your legs get sprained?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been forced to stand outside the classroom, but my feet hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So you should ensure that you don't have to stand outside the classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am confident...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That I will forget to do my homework, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So I ask you, do you have a gadget to protect my feet from getting sprained?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the Gorgon's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:01:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a very terrifying gadget, so you must be careful when you use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.45,0:01:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's eyes spurt out beams which can eat your tissues and turn you into a stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want such a gadget!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you just have to be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.26,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim at your legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.23,0:01:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move my feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your feet have became stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Since your feet are now stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.90,0:01:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your feet can't get sprained even if you stand for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You are right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you pull this snake's hood-shaped Gorgon's hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take it to school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, you forgot to do your homework again!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:01:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand outside the classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:01:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How breezy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it feels like I'm sitting on a stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.85,0:02:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can now turn anyone I hate into a stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But, no, it's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I should make my hand turn into a stone... and hit Giant...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He would then get dizzy and faint!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.37,0:02:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.91,0:02:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that happy to stand outside the classroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.38,0:02:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand here for the rest of today!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm late to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I dropped the Gorgon's Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.23,0:02:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You dropped Gorgon's Head!???
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I dropped it at the hill behind our school!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone approaches it, they will turn into a stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We must capture it at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.91,0:03:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But it can move around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It knows how to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But thankfully, its speed is very slow like that of a tortoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But how are we going to find and capture it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be careful not to get spotted by it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.80,0:03:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly find it and close it with this box.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we could find it ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.81,0:03:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He has turned into a stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down, it should be somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So there it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.33,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My feet can't move, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:04:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon has turned into a stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.89,0:04:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Is it that terrifying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be bad if we can't capture it ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll help me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault, you must capture it by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we can't capture it soon, it will go into your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But that'd be a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, It is your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault for doing weird things!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, I have a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask more, follow me and you will know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.97,0:04:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, if you go deep into the forest...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gorgon will...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I am going to hide here. You two find and lure it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll run ahead of you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.37,0:05:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, how dare you push me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.51,0:05:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, you captured it all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you capture that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It is unimaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I let it run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was my responsibility!